intro_lines = Array[String](["Welcome to the Living Room. Toggle your flashlight with [F] and aim it with your mouse. Entities hide in the dark until your beam hits them.", "Enter the next room. Hide inside the central Wardrobe with [E], then press [SPACE] to jump out and scare the Ghost (+Sanity & +Glitch).", "Notice there is NO door to the 3rd room—only a faint sliver of light leaking through the eastern wall. One wall brick has no collision hitbox. Walk straight through the bug to reach the exit!"])
